# Collision reaction: the wrist runs into a wall (plant contact: 100 N/mm)
# during a line at up to ~95 mm/s. Without the guard, LinuxCNC estops at
# the detection and the brakes hold the arm pressed into the wall (the
# tool stays under tension); with the guard (shared/robot/guard.c) the arm
# stops, backs off 20 mm along its path, and only then estops: no contact
# force left, ~15 mm clear.
@program arm/arm_sim
@args arm/arcmate/arcmate.arm
@include arm/tests/inc_wall.txt
mark
lmove 6 1100 0 1271 0 0 0
run 4
print clear contact off
@expect arm.off_reason[1] == 2
@expect arm.contact_f[1] > 100
@expect arm.clear[1] < 0
@reject ^ERROR
